# name: follow_human
# description: follow the closest person at a safe distance to help carry things
# triggers: follow me, follow the human, follow person, follow the person, come with me, help me carry, carry mode
# plan: follow the closest person at a safe distance@FOLLOW
#
# MOVE semantics, NOT push — it keeps a safe standoff and never drives into the
# person. Tracks the closest person, eases to a stop ~1m away, and steers to keep
# them in view as they move. Runs until you press Stop.

PRINT "Following you at a safe distance — press Stop to end."
SET r = FOLLOW("person", 1.0)
PRINT "Stopped following."
